WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,330
Want to die

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:11,320
It’s not that easy Chang Cheng

3
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,520
Who are these people?

4
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,200
Uncle, it's no big deal

5
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,280
Several blind cowboys from other places lost their way in Jinshan

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,720
He came into my house and stole something.

7
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:20,970
This blind cow

8
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:23,130
That's blind Niu Zicheng

9
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,690
I'll keep an eye on you here in the village

10
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:34,360
No one has sex with tongues. It’s hard work. It’s okay.

11
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,200
Let him coax someone down by himself

12
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:40,240
If you really want to shoot, don’t shoot.

13
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:46,480
The one who falls now is him, so tie him up
